        "notes": "Our game contains:\r\n\r\nViolence:\r\nThe ability to kill characters with fists, melee weapons, throwables, guns and a bow.\r\nBlood splatter on hands and enemies after killing.\r\nBlood trails as environment decoration.\r\nPeople/monsters impaled on stakes (though not gory).\r\n\r\nAlcohol reference but not use or consumption of alcohol:\r\nVisible alcohol bottles used as crafting materials.\r\nThere's a pub that can be found in the Village\r\n\r\nImplied Nudity:\r\nA \"Feral\" character with covered genitals. Their torso is showing but there are no nipples. \r\n\r\nPotential Suicide Depiction:\r\nAn ambiguous scene where the player jumps into a pit, potentially a form of suicide, though not definitively death. \r\n\r\nCultist Rituals:\r\nThe presence of the staked people/monsters indicates cultist rituals."
